      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer by chief rabbi of the United Hebrew Congregations of the British Empire Nathan Marcus Adler is found in an order of service prepared for the celebration of Queen Victoria’s jubilee in 1887. Many thanks to Shufra Judaica (Elli Fischer and David Selis) for contributing the page images of the prayer pamphlet from which our transcription was derived.</tei:p>
